<title>USA: Dow Jones CEO sees 96 EPS at $1.92 - $1.96.</title>
<headline>Dow Jones CEO sees 96 EPS at $1.92 - $1.96.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dow Jones &amp; Co chairman and chief executive officer Peter Kann said on Wednesday the company expects to report 1996 net income in the range of $1.92 to $1.96 per share.</p>
<p>Kann gave the estimate at the PaineWebber media conference here.</p>
<p>In October, Dow Jones said that 1996 earnings would be slightly below 1995 net income of $189.6 million, or $1.96 a share.</p>
